# Process Tracker Executions Log

## Format
Each line is a JSON object representing one execution record.

```json
{"type": "start", "process": "<name>", "executionId": "<uuid>", "timestamp": "<iso8601>", "context": {...}}
{"type": "phase", "process": "<name>", "executionId": "<uuid>", "phase": "<name>", "timestamp": "<iso8601>", "duration": <seconds>}
{"type": "complete", "process": "<name>", "executionId": "<uuid>", "timestamp": "<iso8601>", "totalDuration": <seconds>, "outcome": "success|failure", "notes": "<string>"}
```

